Subject: [PATCH] fan-control: initialize recovered reads and preserve edited fields

Initialize all form fields on the first successful GetFans response, including
automatic retries. Refresh untouched controls and persistence after external
IPMI changes, retaining user edits against the last displayed values. Track
read generations and disable inputs during writes so stale reads and edits
cannot replace the saved selection. Keep exact custom and mixed duties.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD fan settings UI]

